course: dictionary
lesson: 14264
title: Nigerien: from Niger
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Nigerien is an adjective that means from or to do with Niger, a large country in West Africa. Look at the clues in the sentence. «The Nigerien desert is very hot in the day.» Here Nigerien tells us which desert: the one in Niger. Swap in "the desert of Niger" and the sentence still makes sense, so you have the right meaning.
explain: Nigerien can also be a noun, meaning a person from Niger. «Amina is a Nigerien who lives in Niamey.» The word "a" in front is a clue: it shows that Nigerien is naming a person, not describing one.
explain: Be careful not to mix it up with Nigeria. Nigeria is a different country, right next door to Niger. A person from Nigeria is Nigerian, not Nigerien.
fact: Niger is a large, hot country in West Africa.
fact: Most of Niger is covered by the Sahara Desert.
fact: The capital city of Niger is Niamey.
fact: The River Niger flows through Niger.
fact: «Nigerien» can describe things, such as a desert, or mean a person from Niger.
exercise: «The Nigerien desert stretches for miles under the hot sun.» What does Nigerien describe? | A tall mountain | *From or to do with Niger | A kind of hot food | From or to do with Norway
exercise: «Ibrahim is a Nigerien who lives in Niamey.» What is Ibrahim? | A city in Africa | *A person from Niger | A type of desert | A river in Africa
exercise: Where is Niger? | South America | *West Africa | East Asia | Northern Europe
test: «The Nigerien capital is Niamey.» What does Nigerien mean here? | *From or to do with Niger | A type of food | A kind of river | Very old
test: Which city is the capital of Niger? | Accra | *Niamey | Lagos | Dakar
exam: Which sentence uses Nigerien as a noun, meaning a person? | *«Amina is a Nigerien who loves football.» | «The Nigerien road is long and dusty.» | «The Nigerien sun is very hot.» | «Nigerien music is lively and bright.»
